    involved in another rebellion, such as Pezzack's, that studied Ravounel's successes.
    Choose two attribute boosts. One must be to Dexterity or Charisma , and one is
    a free attribute boost. You're trained in the Society skill and the Kintargo
    Lore skill. You gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Streetwise] skill
    feat.
